	)
	(text "6 x 1.00 M from PE + 4.99 k: +/-1203 V linear. The divider is a fixed, known 6.005 M path to PE\n(included in the IMD equations, sim/port_design.py sec. 8). First element = HV-PE crossing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 104.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "71d0de99-b355-5074-85bd-c6590a0e6c7f")
	)
	(text "8 x TNPV1210 124 k = 992 k (125 V, 0.13 W each at 1000 V): 1 mA test current. Energised = connected.\nCommon-source C2M1000170D pair (PA-09): blocks either polarity, so a pole below PE cannot leak through\na body diode. TPSI3050 two-wire from the 24 V DO, reinforced. IDSS <= 100 uA each - EOL baseline cal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 226.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aa30520f-6b55-546c-a662-103da9260eab")
	)
