	)
	(text "PE_D: own M4 bond (dividers only). The module disables its own measurement by leaving IMD_SW_P/N\nde-energised (strings open, fail-safe): a passive module still loads each pole with 6.005 M to PE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 304.992 146.496 0)
